### Test with Non-Existent Material
POST {{baseUrl}}/runSurvival
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "caseId": "TEST-INVALID-002",
    "material": "NONEXISTENT_MAT",
    "plant": "MUMBAI",
    "supplierRecoveryWeeks": 4
}

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### OData Queries with Expansion
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Get Materials with specific criticality
GET {{baseUrl}}/Materials?$filter=criticality eq 'HIGH'
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get Suppliers with low OTIF
GET {{baseUrl}}/Suppliers?$filter=otif lt 80
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get Suppliers with declining trend
GET {{baseUrl}}/Suppliers?$filter=trend eq 'DECLINING'
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Count materials by criticality
GET {{baseUrl}}/Materials?$count=true
Content-Type: application/json

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### DASHBOARD APIs
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Dashboard Summary - Get all KPIs
# Returns aggregated metrics for main dashboard view
GET {{baseUrl}}/getDashboardSummary()
Content-Type: application/json

###

### List All Cases
# Returns all cases without filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/listCases()
Content-Type: application/json

###

### List Cases - Filter by Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/listCases(status='Open')
Content-Type: application/json

###

### List Cases - Filter by Priority
GET {{baseUrl}}/listCases(priority='High')
Content-Type: application/json

###

### List Cases - Multiple Filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/listCases(status='Open',priority='High',limit=10)
Content-Type: application/json

###

### List Cases - Filter by Plant
GET {{baseUrl}}/listCases(plant='MUMBAI')
Content-Type: application/json

###

### List Cases - Filter by Supplier
GET {{baseUrl}}/listCases(supplier='ABC_METALS')
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get Case Detail
# Returns full case information with early warning and survival results
GET {{baseUrl}}/getCaseDetail(caseId='CASE-1001')
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get Case Detail - Another Case
GET {{baseUrl}}/getCaseDetail(caseId='CASE-1002')
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get Case History / Timeline
# Returns audit trail of status changes for a case
GET {{baseUrl}}/getCaseHistory(caseId='CASE-1001')
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Delete Case
# Removes a case and its associated results
# WARNING: This permanently deletes the case
POST {{baseUrl}}/deleteCase
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "caseId": "CASE-TEST-DELETE"
}

###

### Inventory Health Overview
# Returns inventory health status for all materials with survival calculations
GET {{baseUrl}}/getInventoryHealth()
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Supplier Risk Overview
# Returns supplier performance and risk metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/getSupplierRiskOverview()
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Risk Analytics
# Returns risk distribution and analytics data for charts
GET {{baseUrl}}/getRiskAnalytics()
Content-Type: application/json

